Keep a shared edges as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into edges.
Place 2 into edges.
Place 3 into edges.
Keep a shared starts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into starts.
Place 1 into starts.
Place 2 into starts.
Place 3 into starts.
Keep a shared counts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 1 into counts.
Place 1 into counts.
Place 1 into counts.
Place 0 into counts.
Keep a shared queue as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared seen as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every room from 0 to 3.
Place 0 into seen.

Place 0 into queue.
Set item 0 of seen to 1.
The head is 0.
The count is 1.
Repeat while head is less than count.
The node is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
For every offset from 0 to item node of counts minus 1.
The target is item (item node of starts plus offset) of edges.
If item target of seen is 0.
Set item target of seen to 1.
Place target into queue.
Add 1 to count.

The reached is 0.
For every room from 0 to 3.
If item room of seen is 1, add 1 to reached.

If reached is 4, show true, otherwise show false.
